direction_54 = location "Kecoon Captain" about "Kecoon Captain\nKekoons are the offspring of evil soldiers and live on the outskirts of Moradon. They live and hunt in groups and often raid human villages." found "Moradon" at 658 291 in zone 21

On offer
    Say "Have you seen the Kecoon Captains around the castle? It's alarming how their numbers have suddenly shot up."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Yaaah... hunting about 5 of them would do the trick. I'll pay you loads."

On in_progress
    Say "Hey! Is the mission over yet?"
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_54

On ready
    Say "Yahoo! Well done. Now let's go and get that reward from Patrick."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Good job. It was clever of me to ask you to do that. Heh! Here's the reward I promised."
